<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Driven 2 Be Better | Health, Movement & Mindset</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link
        href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Caveat:wght@500;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header class="site-header">
        <div class="container nav">

            <a href="#" class="brand">
                <span class="brand-name">Driven 2 Be Better</span>
                <span class="brand-tagline">HEALTHY PEOPLE GO FURTHER</span>
            </a>

            <nav>
                <a href="#home">Home</a>
                <a href="#story">About</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="#assessment" class="nav-cta">Take the Assessment</a>
            </nav>

        </div>
    </header>


    <main>

        <!-- =======================
     HERO
======================= -->

        <section class="hero" id="home">

            <!-- Decorative collage items -->
            <img src="images/scale.png" class="collage scale" alt="Bathroom scale">

            <img src="images/tape-measure.png" class="collage tape" alt="Measuring tape">

            <img src="images/journal.png" class="collage journal" alt="Journal">

            <img src="images/truck.jpg" class="collage travel-photo truck-photo" alt="Truck traveling on the highway">

            <img src="images/plane.jpg" class="collage travel-photo plane-photo" alt="Airplane">

            <img src="images/bus.jpg" class="collage travel-photo bus-photo" alt="Bus traveling">

            <div class="container hero-grid">

                <div class="hero-copy">

                    <p class="eyebrow">REAL PEOPLE • REAL LIFE • REAL PROGRESS</p>

                    <h1>
                        Your Surgery<br>
                        Is a Tool.
                        <span>Let's Build on It.</span>
                    </h1>

                    <h2>
                        Considering weight-loss surgery—or already on the other side?
                    </h2>

                    <p class="lead">
                        Take a free <strong>Health, Movement & Mindset Assessment</strong>
                        designed to help you look beyond the scale and explore practical
                        ways to support your health at home, at work, or on the road.
                    </p>

                    <div class="personal-story">
                        <p>
                            I had weight-loss surgery in <strong>August 2020</strong>.
                            I've <strong>lost 180 pounds and kept it off.</strong>
                        </p>

                        <p>
                            Now I use my experience as both a
                            <strong>professional driver and yoga teacher</strong>
                            to explore practical ways to move, feel and live better—
                            wherever life takes us.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <p class="script-line">
                        Small steps. Big changes.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <!-- Assessment form -->

                <aside class="assessment-card" id="assessment">

                    <h2>
                        Take the Free<br>
                        Health, Movement &<br>
                        Mindset Assessment
                    </h2>

                    <p>
                        Discover where you are today and identify areas
                        you may want to explore next.
                    </p>

                    <form>

                        <label for="first-name">First Name</label>
                        <input type="text" id="first-name" name="first-name" placeholder="First Name" required>

                        <label for="email">Email Address</label>
                        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Email Address" required>

                        <button type="submit">
                            TAKE THE FREE ASSESSMENT →
                        </button>

                    </form>

                    <small>
                        🔒 Your information stays private. No spam.
                    </small>

                    <p class="card-script">
                        A healthier you can take you further.
                    </p>

                </aside>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =======================
     BENEFITS
======================= -->

        <section class="benefits">

            <div class="container">

                <div class="benefit-grid">

                    <article class="benefit">
                        <div class="icon">🏋️</div>
                        <h3>Functional Movement</h3>
                        <p>
                            Simple, approachable ways to move better
                            in everyday life.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="benefit">
                        <div class="icon">🧘</div>
                        <h3>Mindfulness Support</h3>
                        <p>
                            Practical tools for stress, breathing
                            and staying grounded.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="benefit">
                        <div class="icon">🛣️</div>
                        <h3>Real-Life Solutions</h3>
                        <p>
                            Ideas designed around work, travel,
                            home and changing schedules.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="benefit">
                        <div class="icon">✈️</div>
                        <h3>For Life on the Road</h3>
                        <p>
                            Movement strategies that don't
                            depend on having a gym nearby.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="benefit">
                        <div class="icon">🤝</div>
                        <h3>Support Without Judgment</h3>
                        <p>
                            Start where you are—not where
                            somebody thinks you should be.
                        </p>
                    </article>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>


        <!-- =======================
     REAL LIFE SECTION
======================= -->

        <section class="real-life" id="story">

            <div class="real-life-overlay"></div>

            <div class="container real-life-content">

                <div>

                    <p class="eyebrow light">
                        DRIVEN 2 BE BETTER
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        Health Has to Work<br>
                        Where Life Actually Happens.
                    </h2>

                    <p class="locations">
                        At home. At work. In a hotel room.<br>
                        At a rest stop. Between flights.<br>
                        Or after a long day behind the wheel.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        Driven 2 Be Better is about finding practical ways
                        to keep moving forward—even when your life doesn't
                        look like the examples in the brochure.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="travel-message">
                    <span>Same Journey.</span>
                    <strong>Bigger Possibilities.</strong>
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <!-- =======================
     FINAL CTA
======================= -->

        <section class="final-cta">

            <div class="container final-grid">

                <div class="outcomes">
                    <span>⛰️ Stronger Body</span>
                    <span>🧠 Calmer Mind</span>
                    <span>🧭 Greater Confidence</span>
                    <span>📍 More Freedom</span>
                </div>

                <a href="#assessment" class="big-cta">
                    LET'S GO FURTHER →
                </a>

            </div>

        </section>

    </main>


    <footer id="contact">

        <div class="container footer-grid">

            <div>
                <strong>Driven 2 Be Better</strong>
                <p>Healthy People Go Further</p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a href="#">Terms</a>
                <a href="#">Contact</a>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="container disclaimer">
            <p>
                Driven 2 Be Better provides educational wellness,
                movement and mindfulness information and is not a
                substitute for medical advice, diagnosis or treatment.
                Always follow the recommendations and restrictions
                provided by your surgeon and healthcare team.
            </p>
        </div>

    </footer>

</body>

</html>